# Healthcare Operations & Performance Analytics

## 1. Project Overview

The **Healthcare Operations & Performance Analytics** project focuses on analyzing healthcare data to understand patient patterns, hospital operations, admission trends, waiting times, and department-level performance.

The project contains **15,000+ healthcare records**. The analysis follows an end-to-end data analytics process, including data understanding, column extraction, data cleaning, data standardization, Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA), KPI development, data visualization, and business insight generation.

Tools Used

* **Python** – Data cleaning, transformation, standardization, and EDA
* **Pandas** – Data manipulation and analysis
* **NumPy** – Numerical analysis
* **Matplotlib** – Data visualization
* **Power BI** – Interactive dashboard development and KPI reporting
* **DAX** – KPI and measure creation
* **Excel** – Data validation and supporting analysis

