# 8. Healthcare KPI Development

KPIs are created to measure healthcare operational performance.

Important KPIs for this project include:

### Total Patients

Measures the total number of patient records.

```text
Total Patients = COUNT(Patient ID)
```

### Total Admissions

Measures the number of admitted patients.

```text
Total Admissions = COUNT(Admitted Patients)
```

### Admission Rate

Measures the percentage of patients who were admitted.

```text
Admission Rate = Total Admissions / Total Patients × 100
```

### Average Waiting Time

Measures the average time patients wait before receiving service.

```text
Average Waiting Time = Average(Waiting Time)
```

### Department Patient Volume

Measures the number of patients handled by each department.

```text
Department Volume = COUNT(Patient ID)
```

### Patient Distribution

Analyzes patients based on:

* Age
* Gender
* Department
* Admission status
* Other available categories

