# 10. DAX Measures

Power BI DAX measures can be created for KPI calculations.

### Total Patients

```DAX
Total Patients = COUNTROWS('Healthcare Data')
```

### Total Admissions

```DAX
Total Admissions =
CALCULATE(
    COUNTROWS('Healthcare Data'),
    'Healthcare Data'[Admission Status] = "Admitted"
)
```

### Admission Rate

```DAX
Admission Rate =
DIVIDE(
    [Total Admissions],
    [Total Patients],
    0
)
```

### Average Waiting Time

```DAX
Average Waiting Time =
AVERAGE('Healthcare Data'[Waiting Time])
```

> Column names should be adjusted to match the actual dataset.

